  "interpretation": [
    "All3 S300 satisfy the validation stable rule at steps0/100/0, with inherited L training. Best steps1500/1000/100, stopping1500/2000/1000. Firstseed best is final; no post-best future exists for that seed.",
    "Sbest test AbsRel .086568646264 (SD .001560473388), RMSE .345521634536, delta1 .935044943036, F1 .437134744897, band .146429870312. Sfinal AbsRel .086186299437, F1 .435681275713.",
    "Relative to actual Lbest, Sbest AbsRel difference +.000068052 has CI[-.000376698,.000528922]; no supported AbsRel benefit. RMSE and delta1 improve in all3seeds, band improves mean with two stronger gains/third near tie, while mean F1 worsens (-.007263187) with two worse/third near tie.",
    "Sfinal versus Lbest improves aggregate overall3 and band but lowers F1 in all3seeds. Its AbsRel advantage is -.000314295, CI[-.000539136,-.000084388]. These descriptive endpoints do not replace validation-selected best.",
    "Versus B0, both S endpoints improve overall3 and band but worsen mean F1 (first and third seeds worse, second slightly better). Versus J, S improves mean overall3 and band but has substantially lower F1; not a universally superior method.",
    "Sfinal versus Lfinal F1 advantage is mostly protection from L300114 severe endpoint edge loss; S remains below its actual Lbest parent's mean F1. L300114's recorded training wall/sampling gap is retained in S whole-route cost, with no invented cause.",
    "Fixed firstseed images show modest change from Lbest, lower dining-room depth error but slightly worse edge matching, and kitchen regression versus B0. Sbest/final same arrays for firstseed; this visual equality is expected from shared checkpoint, not an independent replication."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Sbest uses validation-selected residual weights on frozen samecount/sameseed Lbest. Sfinal-versus-Lfinal is a method-endpoint comparison, not the isolated added-residual effect; actual_parent_pairs always uses Lbest.",
    "All descriptive intervals condition on3trainingseeds and215testscenes without multiplecomparisoncorrection. Meanseed differences and signs retained; no test selection.",
    "All S seed-stability decisions come from validation. Ownstage0 does not mean zero total training: parent training and selection already occurred. Three-seed inference timings are observational and not a dedicatedbenchmark.",
    "Actualvisualreviewcovers only3fixedimages atseed320112 and bothendpoints; full654and all3seeds numerically evaluated."
  ]
